    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970411.0435\n\nKINSHASA, April 11 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Zairean premier forms government\n\n\n\n\nZairean Prime Minister General Likulia Bolongo on Friday announced the formation of a \"national salvation\" government which includes two generals.\n\nGenerals were appointed to the posts of interior and defense minister while former foreign minister Gerard Kamanda Wa Kamanda was reappointed.",
